MicroPython \.\+ version
Use \.\+
>>> # REPL tests of UTF-8 line editing
>>> # typed characters are kept
>>> 'あいう', len('日本語')
('\u3042\u3044\u3046', 3)
>>> # backspace and delete remove whole characters
>>> 'あいう'[Kう'xう'
'\u3042x\u3046'
>>> 'éàü'[Kü'üy'
'\xe9\xfcy'
>>> # cursor movement over characters
>>> 語''語'日語'本語'
'\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e'
>>> # history recall then edit
>>> '𝄞♪'
'\U0001d11e\u266a'
>>> '𝄞♪'[K[K♫'
'\U0001d11e\u266b'
>>> \$
